<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain key money rate unchanged at 5.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain key money rate unchanged at 5.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said it left its key money rate unchanged at 5.75 percent at Tuesday's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 3.556 trillion pesetas against an equal amount bid.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
